      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Read the digital edition of Screen’s second awards weekly for 2026/27, which focuses on the international Oscar and Bafta races, and the documentaries in contention."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The issue features a guide to each region’s awards hopefuls, plus profiles of Woman Unknown , Possible Love and NAZA . It also explores the docs that tackle themes of activism and migration in this season’s awards race."
